OL,3,ATeen's life transformed by gene editing
OL,4,
OL,5,FA teenager has revealed how her life
OL,6,Fhas been transformed thanks to
OL,7,Fpioneering gene editing, which reversed
OL,8,Fsymptoms of a crippling blood disorder.
OL,10,FVian, 16, was born with thalassemia, a
OL,11,Fcondition that affects haemoglobin -
OL,12,Fused by red blood cells to transport
OL,13,Foxygen around the body. It left her
OL,14,Fshort of breath and with no appetite.
OL,16,FHer own stem cells were edited and she
OL,17,Fno longer needs the monthly blood
OL,18,Ftransfusions she endured for most of
OL,19,Fher life.
OL,21,F"My whole life's different now. It's
OL,22,Fchanged so much," she said.
